{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene! How's it going? We haven't talked in a while. I've been busy getting ready for a yoga retreat with some buddies. A chance to hang out with people who think like me and find peace and understanding. Sounds awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-b84db061350a3ee73ef5d413", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.429679+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b84db061350a3ee73ef5d413", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b84db061350a3ee73ef5d413", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Deb! Been super hectic with internship and stuff. That retreat sounds awesome, I could definitely use a break!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-9230f89c46dea6bafc602638", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.457099+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9230f89c46dea6bafc602638", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9230f89c46dea6bafc602638", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: By the way, I tried a new pose - Dancer Pose (Natarajasana). Rate, did I succeed?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-c20316ead0f742775923fab3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.560990+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c20316ead0f742775923fab3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c20316ead0f742775923fab3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: You are amazing as always! Here are new photos of Seraphim in the new aquarium that I bought the day before yesterday."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-8c97b54700724b567939d674", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.573619+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8c97b54700724b567939d674", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8c97b54700724b567939d674", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Where'd you get it? I'm always drawn to animals, they bring so much joy. What's its story?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-9fc5a581e0cbf561e7e92b3f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.585304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9fc5a581e0cbf561e7e92b3f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9fc5a581e0cbf561e7e92b3f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I got her last year, she's a great pet. She always cheers me up and brings a sense of peace. Spending time with her is so comforting."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-c5a955e145ea921e867dc399", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.601103+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c5a955e145ea921e867dc399", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c5a955e145ea921e867dc399", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Pets really do make life more enjoyable and bright."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-54c185511ee971467105d3e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.611078+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54c185511ee971467105d3e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54c185511ee971467105d3e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm so thankful it's here. Plus, it's nice to have a calm creature around."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-8fb544b15b9b3dafe23eb34e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.622060+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8fb544b15b9b3dafe23eb34e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8fb544b15b9b3dafe23eb34e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: How have things been besides that?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-7ce8c205b570235a4ed1099f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.630179+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ce8c205b570235a4ed1099f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ce8c205b570235a4ed1099f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Things have been intense lately. I'm really pushing myself to succeed, and sometimes it feels overwhelming. But I'm determined to overcome any obstacles and achieve my goals."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-cd006eddc76bb3f15fec8f46", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.638426+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cd006eddc76bb3f15fec8f46", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cd006eddc76bb3f15fec8f46", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Keep up the hard work and remember to relax too."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-b02367bff25ed662a7a4d18c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.654977+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b02367bff25ed662a7a4d18c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b02367bff25ed662a7a4d18c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks, Deborah! I had a big breakthrough with this project - so exciting and rewarding!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-ac1226772d51f95173d93193", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.666288+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ac1226772d51f95173d93193", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ac1226772d51f95173d93193", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Awesome, Jolene! I'm really glad your project worked out."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-48/session_14-07972dad4d2003a80f4763d1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:16:02.678741+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "07972dad4d2003a80f4763d1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "07972dad4d2003a80f4763d1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
